                "text": "It's been:\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f 23 days since the government shut down\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f 30 days since Adelita Grijalva won her election\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f 34 days since Republicans last showed up for work\n\nAnd in 9 days, health insurance premiums are going to skyrocket. \n\nRepublicans need to get back to DC and do their jobs. https://t.co/rFwvbUQaan",
